"字段的客户端。其他每个客户端都收到未知路由的 ``404``。``/__sibuna/ready`` 只在边缘上存在。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/reference.rst:85
msgid "The admin socket"
msgstr "管理套接字"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/reference.rst:88
msgid ""
"``global.admin_socket`` (or ``sibuna lb --admin``) opens a Unix socket of "
"mode 0600. ``sibuna ctl SOCKET COMMAND`` sends one line of at most 512 "
"printable ASCII bytes and prints the answer. The socket accepts a burst "
"of 20 commands and 10 per second after it. The console of the edge runs a "
"listed subset of the same lines through the same parser. "
"``cmd/sibuna/src/edge/control.rs`` holds the grammar."
msgstr ""
"``global.admin_socket``\\ （或 ``sibuna lb --admin``）打开一个权限为 0600 的 Unix "
"套接字。``sibuna ctl SOCKET COMMAND`` 发送一行至多 512 个可打印 ASCII "
"字节的命令，并打印应答。该套接字接受突发 20 条命令，之后每秒 10 条。边缘的控制台通过同一个解析器运行这些命令行中列出的一个子集。语法位于 "
"``cmd/sibuna/src/edge/control.rs``。"

